Here's a step-by-step guide to help you achieve this:

### Step 1: Configure Keycloak Adapter

Ensure that you have the Keycloak adapter configured correctly in your Spring Boot application. You need to add the necessary dependencies and configuration properties.

#### Dependencies
Add the following dependencies to your `pom.xml`:

```xml
<dependency>
    <groupId>org.keycloak</groupId>
    <artifactId>keycloak-spring-security-adapter</artifactId>
    <version>22.0.1</version>
</dependency>
