### Strategy 1: Prioritize One Role Over Others

If you want to prioritize one role over others, you can check for the highest priority role first and then proceed to lower priority roles if necessary.

### Strategy 2: Allow Access Based on Any Required Role

If you want to allow access based on the presence of any of the required roles, you can check if any of the required roles are present in the user's list of roles.

