#### Load Balancing
- Use load balancers to distribute incoming logs evenly across nodes.

### 8. Monitoring and Maintenance

#### Monitoring
- Use tools like Prometheus and Grafana to monitor the health and performance of your logging system.
- Set up alerts for critical metrics like CPU usage, memory usage, and log processing rates.

